SYMBOL,PLEDGE_PCT
# Promoter pledge %, refreshed by hand each quarter.
#
# The NSE bulk pledge endpoints return HTTP 404 - the path was retired, so no
# proxy or session recovers it. Shareholding data changes four times a year,
# so a file maintained per quarter is a fair substitute for a daily feed.
#
# Source: BSE or NSE corporate-filings shareholding pattern for the company.
# Rows outside 0-100 and rows that will not parse are skipped with a count.
#
# Override the path with PLEDGE_CSV=... if you keep it elsewhere.
VEDL,38.42
